+    </section>
+    <section aria-labelledby="delivery">
+      <h2 id="delivery">Delivering these pages</h2>
+      <p>To deliver a page, our hosting provider receives your IP address and normal request information,
+        such as the requested address and browser headers. Hosting infrastructure may retain access or
+        security logs. The source code does not configure that retention; it depends on the hosting provider.
+        Avoid including personal information or secrets in page addresses.</p>
+    </section>
+    <section aria-labelledby="scope">
+      <h2 id="scope">What this notice covers</h2>
+      <p>This notice covers the static Daily Grind website. Account, rewards, ordering, and contact
+        services are not implemented here. Any future service that collects information must explain
+        its purpose, retention, and access or deletion options before collection begins.</p>
+    </section>
+  </main>
+  <footer>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co.</p>
+    <a href="/">Return to home</a>
+  </footer>
